@startuml CrossView Consistency Considerations

' title "36. CrossView Consistency Considerations for Human Benchmark System"

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor gray
skinparam noteBackgroundColor lightyellow

' Define the architectural views as components
component "Deployment View" as DV #LightBlue
component "Functional View" as FV #LightGreen
component "Information View" as IV #LightPink
component "Concurrency View" as CV #LightCyan
component "Development View" as DevV #LightGray

' Consistency requirements between views

left to right direction


' Define relationships between views
DV -- FV : "must align with"
note on link
    Consistency with Functional View
    - Runtime element-to-node mapping must align with functional elements
    - Each functional element must have clear deployment location
end note

DV -- IV : "must support"
note on link
    Consistency with Information View
    - Database deployment specifications must support data structures
end note


DV -- CV : "must provide resources for"
note on link
    Consistency with Concurrency View
    - Deployment environment must provide sufficient resources
    - Must support concurrent processes and threads
    - Must handle multiple simultaneous users in multiplayer scenarios
end note

DV -- DevV : "must align with"
note on link
    Consistency with Development View
    - Technology dependency model must align with development environment
    - Supported libraries and technologies must be the same
end note

' Maintaining consistency section
note bottom of DV
    <b>Maintaining Consistency</b>
    - Changes to functional elements must be reflected in deployment mappings
    - Scaling decisions must consider functional and concurrency impacts
    - Technology upgrades must be coordinated across views
    - Review and update whenever significant changes are made
end note

' legend right
'     <b>Cross-View Consistency Legend</b>
'     |= Color |= Architectural View |
'     | <back:LightBlue>   </back> | Deployment View |
'     | <back:LightGreen>  </back> | Functional View |
'     | <back:LightPink>   </back> | Information View |
'     | <back:LightCyan>   </back> | Concurrency View |
'     | <back:LightGray>   </back> | Development View |
' end legend

@enduml